  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_myrrh_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_myrrh_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Lucky Charm",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_myrrh_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b8ad71a15a3669e1e25035e6f55b57c9e4b769791bf794579fe443b7d6b04c97",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "末药"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rhodes Island Ursus Outpost"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Yawn*... Morning meeting after hitting the hay at four last night? Gimme a break..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why don't you look tired at all, Sussurro?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We were taught at school to put on a proper appearance at work, so—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you had three cups of espresso first thing in the morning. Not exactly a healthy lifestyle, Operator Sussurro."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ahem. Now that Hibiscus is here, let's start the meeting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, before that we need to introduce our newest colleague. Come on in, Operator Myrrh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "G-Good morning. I'm Myrrh, and I've just been made an operator. You can also call me by my real name, Adelaide."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's been assigned to us after completing her internship. Operator Myrrh, meet Operator Gavial."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good morning, Miss Gavial."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just call me Gavial."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Glad to have you onboard. We can always use more medics. Can't even remember the last time I got a good night's sleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're doing what we can to recruit more. Just try not to scare away the rookies before they even get settled in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I-I'm ready for it. Dr. Kal'tsit told me that the job of a medic is really tough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good to hear you've gotten advance warning. Things are really hectic around here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's Operator Sussurro next to Gavial. She'll be your supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "G-Good morning, Miss Sussurro. I look forward to working with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right. Just so you know, us operators don't really call each other 'Miss'. And don't worry, we'll ease you in gradually."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I-I'll do my best. Please let me know whenever I'm doing something wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Seriously, we're just thankful to have you here to take on some of the workload."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ahem. Then shall we get to today's schedule?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The refugees' conditions are all under control on my end. If all goes well, we should be able to release some of them by next month."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about you, Hibiscus?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Most of the patients are fine, except for one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mrs. Luba."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is she doing badly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Her condition isn't all that bad, but she's been refusing treatment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait. She's sick, but doesn't want to get treated?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's a superstitious one. When she first came, she told me not to waste my time because her village shaman told her she wouldn't live past seventy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Seems a little dodgy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She believes every word of it, though, even seeing everyday events as signs that the end is near."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She practically fled when she saw Kuro outside last Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Apparently, seeing a black Originium slug is an omen that death approaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So that's why she was crying all day. Wouldn't even take her meals."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) Maybe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's just a tough situation all around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me, Sussurro? May I try talking to her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you sure? It takes more than medical expertise to work with a patient like her. You need communication skills too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are many superstitious people where I'm from, and I've picked up a few tricks to deal with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you sure about this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why not let her have a go? Not like we've got any better ideas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "P-Please. I want to do this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Very well then, give it a shot. Gavial, could you bring up Mrs. Luba's patient history for her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you, Gavial."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are we sure about this, Sussurro? I still think we should think it through."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gavial's right though, we don't have any other ideas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Be sure to report back if you encounter any trouble with her. We'll do what we can to support you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll do my best."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Welp, then follow me, Myrrh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Was there anything else you wanted to say, Hibiscus?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Er, well, I'm still a little worried. Dr. Kal'tsit told me about some of her... quirks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sussurro",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Such as?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's just say that she has some superstitions of her own."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rhodes Island Field Hospital"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mrs. Luba should be here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Enough! Take it away! I don't need it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me, what's going on in there? She sounded angry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic Operator",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, you must be the new doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic Operator",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I spilled a jar of salt. Apparently that's a taboo in Ursus, like it's really unlucky for them, so she's fuming mad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic Operator",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe you should come back later, let her get it out of her system."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry, I'm just here to say hi."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I said I don't need it! What are y— Oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good morning, Mrs. Luba."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And who are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My name is Myrrh, and I'm your new doctor. I'll be working with you to treat your symptoms—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get out, girl, and take your medicine with you! Stop wasting your time on me and let me go in peace!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, Mrs. Luba, I, er, didn't bring any medicine today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then what are you here for? Trying to talk me out of my 'superstitions' again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, not at all. I've never been very good at talking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then, what? You here to gawk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, I, er, brought something for you. It's a lucky charm from home that I've been carrying for years. My clan chief told me that it brings good luck to whoever wears it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Takes the charm from her neck and gives it to the old woman)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry if it's a little worn."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A little thing like this... Well, thank you anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's gotten me out of trouble so many times over the years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I didn't think you young folk believed in these things anymore. Everyone's always on about 'science' and 'evidence' and that only backwards, uneducated folk like me still believe this stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "People always tell me that I'm superstitious too. I always go into a room with my left foot first, and the first thing I do when I move to a new place is set up some fowlbeast feathers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm a little afraid to even talk about these things with my peers. Many of them graduated from med school, and they just sneer at this stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're too young to believe in fate. When you get to my age, you realize that some things that are just out of the hands of us mortals."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When I was little, a fortune teller said I was fated for hardship for the rest of my life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I didn't believe it back then, but look at me now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My village got caught up in a Catastrophe, my only daughter's dead from it, and now I'm sick in my old age. I'm not long for this world."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, Mika... How could you leave your mother all alone like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Takes the old woman's hands) Mrs. Luba..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it? Bored with my griping?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, not at all. I want to know more. Tell me about your daughter. Considering how well you've aged, your daughter must have been truly beautiful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And here you said you weren't any good at talking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right, my Mika was the jewel of the village. Her golden hair was like silk, so smooth and shiny."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, my poor girl... life means nothing without her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everything tastes so bland these days. And each day is just about making it to the next one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Would you like some sour apple pie?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where's this coming from? What is it anyway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a new item on the canteen menu. The tangy flavor really works up the appetite."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not hungry. Just stay and chat with me for a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go on then, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mika always loved apples. Not the sweet ones, but the sour ones."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I could never handle anything too sour. It makes my teeth curl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My Mika always had such great teeth..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_iceforest_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The air outside smells so fresh after last night's snow, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stopping by so early? Don't you have work to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry, my schedule isn't that packed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You doctors always seem so busy. Didn't think you'd have time to listen to me babble."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hehe, would you rather I didn't come then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Girl..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To be honest, it's good to see you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I feel the same way. I couldn't stop thinking about you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why? What do you see in a washed-up old woman like me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're about my grandma's age, and you even look a little alike. Seeing you reminds me of her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If I had a granddaughter, she'd be about your age now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You must've really loved your grandma then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. She taught me everything I know about wild forest herbs, and how to use them for medicine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She also taught me how to find my way, so I'm never lost no matter where I go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you miss home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Me too... but I won't see it again. And I won't ever see my Mika either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't cry, Mrs. Luba. She'll come back to you, someday."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you on about? How can somebody who's dead come back to me?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Please, don't get angry. It's just what we say in my clan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We believe that the spirit of the woods guides the dead to the Great Green, where they become one with nature."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whenever someone in my clan dies, we gather by the river and send down a little boat holding a candle, in order to light the way back for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even if what you said is true, and Mika really came back... what would she become?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know. Maybe the stars and the wind in the sky, or the snow and the rain on a lake."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or the grass under our feet, soft and lovely..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the land's so big. How could I find her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We... we can't find them ourselves. We can only wait for them to find us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's why our chief leads the guiding dance at funerals, so that those who are gone can find their way back and reunite with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Girl..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you... know the dance? Can you dance for her? For Mika?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I want to see her. No matter what she's become."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Myrrh did not know how bad her dancing was.\nHer steps were slow and out of sync with her arms. Even a farmer tilling the fields would look more elegant and coordinated.\nHer movements were clumsy and comical, like a baby fowlbeast flailing in the snow.\nBut Luba did not laugh. As Myrrh made circles in the snow, waving her arms, a cold morning wind brushed against the hair on Luba's brow.\nShe closed her eyes and felt the air rush past her cheek. Something warm filled her eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Girl..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Falls) T-The world's spinning... I'm spinning..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mrs. Luba? W-What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go back. I'm in the mood for some sour apple pie."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One month later..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There you are, Adelaide. Good to see you one last time before I leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your symptoms are under control, and should remain stable for the foreseeable future. As long as you watch your diet and take the suppressant regularly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you so much for doing all this for an old sack of bones like me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm just doing my job. Oh, before I forget... here, I got you a sour apple pie to eat on the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aw, aren't you just a sweetheart? You remember my favorite."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll see you off then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure thing, love."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Before I came here, I was all outta hope. I would just sit on my bed all day, wishing to kick the bucket already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Until I met you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now I can feel Mika by my side all the time. I see her whenever I look at the mountains, the trees, the flowers, the grass, the rain, the snow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I want to see more, to keep seeing her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And to do that, I've gotta keep on living."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sure she'd be happy. Take care, Mrs. Luba. I'm not sure how often we can see each other again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come now, pull yourself together."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Myrrh smiles and takes the old woman's hand. The two of them walk quietly over the snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only when they have arrived at the village gate does the old woman hesitantly begin to speak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Adelaide... let me ask you something. Answer me honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All that stuff you told me... is it really true?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mrs. Luba..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I mean, do you believe it? Be honest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When I was little, the chief would brew me medicine whenever I was sick. And I always got better soon after taking it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I used to think it was so amazing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But when I came to the landship, I began to study its composition, to learn medicine in a systematic matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's when I found that it was just a common herbal drink, with no special effects."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So I put away my research on it, and turned to studying other medicines."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I still find myself making it whenever I get sick, simply out of habit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And not just when I'm sick - I do it when an experiment didn't go well, or when I can't sleep, or when I scrape my knee after a fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why do you keep drinking it, even though you know it has no effect?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not sure why... sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why... why, indeed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is it all true, Harmonia? Does this dance really bring the dead back to our side? Does the Great Green really exist?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harmonia",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Adelaide... I can't answer that question, because I don't know either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why do you join the chief in the guiding dance then, if you don't know sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harmonia",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Because I hope that it's true, and that someday we'll reunite with the ones who have left us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harmonia",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's why I dance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harmonia",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This land has too many troubles and hardships. The helpless must learn to help themselves, and the lost must learn to find their own answers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harmonia",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's why we place our hopes on the ethereal, on the supernatural."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harmonia",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's why we have superstitions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, Harmonia..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I suppose it becomes true if you believe in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Never mind. Who cares if it's true or not, at my age?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There isn't much I can give you, but take this necklace that my man left me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, I can't accept that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just take it. It's nothing valuable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Myrrh",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I appreciate it, but the Medical Department has rules against accepting gifts from patients."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Woman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It'll bring you good luck. Take it, girl, and take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As she watches Mrs. Luba leave, Adelaide rubs her eyes and recalls sitting by Harmonia, gazing at the river in the distance."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
